@startuml US208-SSD
title System Sequence Diagram - US208: Update Airport Details

autonumber
actor "Backoffice Operator" as BO
participant ":System" as Sys

BO -> Sys: Request to update airport details (operational hours, contacts) for a specific IATA code
activate Sys

Sys --> BO: Returns the updated airport details and confirms success
deactivate Sys

@enduml
